        "content": "---\nname: YouTube Upload SOP\ndescription: studio.youtube.com par video upload karne ka step-by-step SOP using browser automation.\n---\n\n# Upload SOP\n\n1. Open studio.youtube.com in AntiGem browser\n2. Click Create > Upload videos\n3. Use chrome.antigem.uploadFiles with the video path\n4. Fill title, description, thumbnail\n5. Publish or schedule\n",
