        "version": "1.0.0",
        "content": "---\nname: YouTube Script Framework\ndescription: Hook-first retention script likhne ka framework — 15s hook, story bridge, CTA.\n---\n\n# YouTube Script Framework\n\nIs skill ka use karke agent retention-optimized scripts likhta hai.\n\n## Structure\n1. **Hook (0-15s)** — bold claim ya question\n2. **Bridge (15-30s)** — promise + credibility\n3. **Body** — 3 value points, har point pe open loop\n4. **CTA** — natural, value-linked\n\nRead `details/retention.md` for advanced retention tactics.\n",
